 stories\", \"keywords\": \"human feedback in AI training, how AI learns from human feedback, reinforcement learning from human feedback explained, human preference data, AI feedback vs human feedback, Constitutional AI, InstructGPT, Dijae Dadula\", \"author\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home#person\", \"name\": \"Dijae Dadula\", \"url\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\", \"jobTitle\": \"AI Automation & Systems Specialist\", \"description\": \"Dijae Dadula designs, deploys, evaluates and secures AI agents, chatbots, CRM pipelines and workflow automation for businesses and professionals.\", \"sameAs\": [\"https://www.youtube.com/c/DijaeDadulaPRO\", \"https://www.threads.com/@dijaedadula\", \"https://ird.dijaedadula.com/\"]}, \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Person\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home#person\", \"name\": \"Dijae Dadula\"}, \"isPartOf\": {\"@type\": \"Blog\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog#blog\", \"url\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"@id\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/human-feedback-ai-training#faq\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is human feedback the same as training a model from scratch?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No. Training from scratch teaches a model language from huge amounts of text. Human feedback comes afterwards and tunes an already capable model toward answers people prefer.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why not let AI judge itself instead of people?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"AI feedback is cheaper and faster, and research such as Constitutional AI shows it can work for some goals. But people still set the principles the AI judges against, and errors in those principles flow straight into the model.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Does more feedback always mean a better model?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Not on its own. The research shows that feedback is limited by what the judges can tell is correct, so expert feedback on hard questions can matter more than a large volume of casual feedback.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can my business chatbot learn from customer thumbs-up and thumbs-down?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Not directly in most platforms; the model itself does not change. Use those signals to find answers to review, then fix the knowledge base or instructions so the next customer gets the right answer.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/home\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Blog\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/blog\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Human Feedback in AI Training\", \"item\": \"https://www.dijaedadula.com/human-feedback-ai-training\"}]}</script><meta property='og:type' content='article'><meta property='og:site_name' content='Dijae Dadula'><meta property='og:url' content='https://www.dijaedadula.com/human-feedback-ai-training'><meta property='og:title' content='Human Feedback in AI Training Explained: How Expert Judgment Makes Models Better'><meta property='og:description' content='Human feedback in AI training in plain English: how models learn from people&#x27;s judgments, why experts matter, the limits and what businesses can borrow.'><meta property='og:image' content='https://statics.pancake.vn/web-media-264/6b/9e/9d/b1/a6fb1f34e72382c729b6d44320b6a5da74b0bdbad65d0b1fc04eadee-w:1536-h:864-l:33087-t:image/jpeg.jpg'><meta property='og:image:width' content='1536'><meta property='og:image:height' content='864'><meta property='og:image:alt' c